flowchart TB
    A["Start here · Inspect the attempt"]
    B{"Any switch write occurred?"}
    C["No changed layout<br/>Repair preparation"]
    D{"Verified receipt and<br/>current switched layout?"}
    E["Keep successful activation<br/>Retain backup until purge"]
    F["Re-establish quiet interval<br/>Run restore with the backup"]
    G{"Native return verified?<br/>Ravel sources off?"}
    H["Stop unsuccessfully<br/>Repair cause before a fresh attempt"]
    I["Keep backup and failed paths<br/>Repair I/O or permissions<br/>Repeat the same restore"]
    A -->|"1"| B
    B -->|"2 no"| C
    B -->|"2 yes or uncertain"| D
    D -->|"3 yes"| E
    D -->|"3 no, including crash"| F
    F -->|"4"| G
    G -->|"5 yes"| H
    G -->|"5 no or restore interrupted"| I
    I -->|"6 explicit retry"| F
